{"server":"cn","storyId":"act17d0_level_act17d0_03_end","groupId":"act17d0","stageId":"act17d0_03","title":"安全屋攻防战","storyCode":"OD-3","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_03_end.txt","sourceHash":"b9456c45eaab4a91073e1ad95d3bb267e2f9e287757cf970c60c0e9e716c924b","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_safehouseoutdoorD"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷鸣！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊啊......我的眼睛！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"术师呢！干掉那个瓦伊凡！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"想都别想。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"什么情况，又多了一批人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么搞的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"情况不妙，这些人的火力太凶猛了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"不要在这里节外生枝，先撤退。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我看见你了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"呃啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"小心狙击手！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"妈的，在哪？！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"别找了，撤了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你跑不掉的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"撤！快撤！别管了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜华","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"他们跑了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"报告情况！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"亚历山大，你没事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，皮外伤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"这些家伙学聪明了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"不要放松警惕！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"还有其他人在这。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"......已经靠得够近了，朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我感谢你们出手相助，但是在我们彼此搞清状况以前，还是保持一点安全距离比较好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要紧张，我们没有敌意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们是罗德岛的外勤小队！你们现在驻扎的区域是罗德岛的安全屋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们是来回应安全屋的求援信号的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请你们表明身份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"冷静点，我们是来帮忙的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"是那个罗德岛的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，还真的把救兵叫来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"去叫奥克芬先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"了解。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛干员？太好了啊，得救了！得救了啊！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_safehouseindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"具体的情况就是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"所以最后这四个雇佣兵就在这里搭建了临时阵地？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"实在是抱歉，通讯器被破坏了，安全屋也没守住......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你们要是现在就辞退我，我也没什么怨言......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"不要担心，老夫也没有辞退你的权力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"而且依老夫来看，你能坚持到现在已经很了不起了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是你，这些感染者的命运会更糟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"这里有多少感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算上外面那个医生，总共四十三个人，都是感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那四个佣兵一直在保护这些感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"主动保护感染者的佣兵，这年头可太少见了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"完全不歧视感染者，甚至主动保护感染者的雇佣兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是我太多疑了，这是从哪儿来的圣人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"但是他们好像没有这个意识。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"听他们的语气，感觉只是保护了普通的无辜镇民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"与其说是“不歧视”感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们更像是“不在乎矿石病”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是他们看起来也不像是感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"我从来没有见过他们这样的佣兵，也没听说过“彩虹小队”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们都拿着铳哎，而且怎么看都不是萨科塔人吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除非萨科塔人已经有办法把“日光灯”藏起来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"非萨科塔雇佣兵全员装备大型铳器，这绝对会变成大新闻的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑钢装备研发部门的人知道了这件事，绝对要发疯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......还是不要在背后议论别人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"无论如何，他们救助了罗德岛的干员，保护了感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"没有证据之前，我们也不该怀疑他们的动机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"当务之急，是想办法解决目前的困境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"我们需要和他们商量一下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_safehouseoutdoorD"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"他们进去有一阵了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"这个罗德岛，你怎么看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜华","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"我其实一直很好奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜华","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"什么样的制药企业和医疗公司，会需要在偏远的边陲城镇周边安插一个堆满了军火的安全屋？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜华","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"那些爆炸物和武器，都能武装一个步兵班了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"而且这些“制药公司”的干员，看起来各个都是专业武装人员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"要么是这世界里当医生都得武装到牙齿了，要么制药企业是个幌子，可能两者皆有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"他们虽然是武装人员，但是看起来训练有素，而且谈吐得体。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"和我们之前遇到的歪瓜裂枣可不太一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"而且......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是我的错觉，但是我总能从他们身上感觉到很熟悉的氛围。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"这个，我倒是同意你的看法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"至少他们是讲道理的文明人，我之前对这整个世界的印象就是个土匪流寇遍地走的末日启示录。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伤口包扎好了，亚历山大先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你，医生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"医生，你了解这个叫作罗德岛的组织吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我从大篷车商队那里听到过一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们是专门救治感染者的组织，也是研究矿石病的科研机构。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"但是这种病不是治不好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实过去有不少人自称“能够治愈矿石病”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些人大部分是骗子，骗局败露之后各个下场凄惨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"极少数不是骗子的人，也都是夸大了“抑制矿石病症状”的效果，这些能够“抑制矿石病”的药物也极其昂贵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以前听说，某个领主的女儿得了矿石病，这位领主为了救自己的女儿，从哥伦比亚高价购买了抑制药。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"几年以后，领主的财富全部消耗殆尽，他的女儿也在病痛中死去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是你们看这个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是安全屋里储备的矿石病抑制药。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这几天我给一些病重的人注射了这种药，它确实能够有效抑制矿石病，而且药效比我以前见过的所有产品都好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样的药......一定非常昂贵吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是奥克芬先生完全不在乎这件事，当我告诉他有人病得非常严重，他就给了我一盒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是不相信这片大地上有好人，只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，这我倒是真没想到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"别多想了，猜忌的成本太高。不管你是否表露出来，都不利于接下来的沟通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"既然大家的目标是一致的，很多事情不妨直接放到台面上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"听你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，他们出来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，让各位久等了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"就让我省略客套话吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你们救了奥克芬，若不是你们，罗德岛会失去一位尽职尽责的干员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"这次任务结束后，我会提交报告，罗德岛会给四位合适的报酬与物资补偿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"报酬啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"有报酬是好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"另外，你们愿意为感染者挺身而出，老夫由衷地表示敬佩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"这些镇民这段时间也帮了我们很多，见死不救不是我们的行事风格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你们是雇佣兵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"不......我们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"是，我们就是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"我们是雇佣兵，很贵的那种。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能透漏一下你们所属的公司吗？像你们这样的雇佣兵实在是太少见了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......我们是......呃......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"（俄语）帮忙想个公司名字！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"（俄语）北极熊物流？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不方便透漏也没有关系，我明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"我们......我们来自一个很遥远的国家，在......在南边！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"对！我们来自很南边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"南边？萨尔贡南边？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"穿过焚风热土？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"焚......对，就是来自那边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"穿过焚风热土还有其他国家？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"这可真是......震撼老夫，这么多年来可是第一次听说这件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是萨尔贡王酋的历史记载中，也从未提及有人曾经穿越干旱之地而来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"（俄语）你编故事也稍微靠谱一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"（俄语）北极熊物流听起来就很靠谱吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，操着乌萨斯和维多利亚口音的战士们，你们来自何处都不重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"你们愿意为感染者而战，在这件事上我们的目的是一致的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"至少现在，至少我们能够一起面对现在的困境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"我同意你的看法，老先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，谁能告诉我们，镇子上到底出什么事了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_safehouseindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹佣兵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"操纵怪物的，应该是术师。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"有组织，有纪律，更重要的是懂得知难而退，这不是临时起意的劫掠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们的装备齐全，全都是哥伦比亚产的军备，之前围攻安全屋的时候，还有几个很厉害的家伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"这个装备和战术，应该是签了“红标合同”的专业佣兵了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"这恐怕是一场针对领主的叛乱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"但是他们为什么要袭击平民？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"他们从感染者社区一路跟着我们到了这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"这些佣兵到底想要什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最大的可能性是灭口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕不只是要灭口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是怎么看的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"他们昨天袭击感染者社区的时候，很明显是冲着病人们去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"他们想把那些病人带走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"我觉得这才是这群人的目的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"绑架......感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这又是什么道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"敌人的目的扑朔迷离，但这并不是眼下最紧要的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"目前，最好的办法是等待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"等待？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然目前没有任何征兆，但是只从既成事实的角度来谈的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"我们没有获得王酋的许可，就持械进入了王酋的领地。无论于王酋的戒律还是本地的法律，我们都已经犯了萨尔贡的大忌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"镇上的贵族深陷兵马之乱，但他们在此地的统治依然存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"此时再插手任何事情，都会让情况对我们更加不利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"本地领主设立了感染者社区，说明他不是残暴无情之人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"他同意罗德岛在这里设立安全屋，说明他不是封闭自守之人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信他会给我们一个公正的待遇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"国家律法......地方政府......我能理解。那现在也只能希望如此了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"在有更多情况变化之前，我们要固守这个安全屋，等待镇上的骚乱结束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"希望你们能够帮助我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"不用客气，我们也需要罗德岛的专业支援。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，四位，合作愉快。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_456_ash","aliases":["灰烬"]},{"speakerId":"char_457_blitz","aliases":["闪击"]},{"speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","aliases":["霜华"]},{"speakerId":"char_459_tachak","aliases":["战车"]},{"speakerId":"char_503_rang","aliases":["巡林者"]}]}
